  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/u1lC7oT.png\" alt=\"Banner\" width=\"3000\" height=\"1482\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Fusion Connected Blocks为许多常见方块（如抛光安山岩、钻石块和书架）添加了连接纹理。</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/LtHOSCD.png\" alt=\"Separator\" width=\"1042\" height=\"148\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">Fusion Connected Blocks需要<img style=\"width:1em\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/835/860/638227854854712053.png\" alt=\"Fusion logo\"> Fusion才能正常运行。您可以通过点击<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion-connected-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>或下方图片找到它。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion-connected-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CelestialAbyss/badges/refs/heads/main/fusion/requires/compact_vector.svg\" alt=\"Requires Fusion\" width=\"364\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5d5A3W5.png\" alt=\"Separator\" width=\"1042\" height=\"148\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">如需未来内容、 upcoming mod的资讯与讨论，欢迎加入SuperMartijn642的Discord服务器！</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" alt=\"Join SuperMartijn642&#x27;s Mods discord server\" width=\"373\" height=\"102\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/zaW7uNI.png\" alt=\"Separator\" width=\"1042\" height=\"148\"></p>",
